From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: apklayer <apklayer@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ShadowDisplayEventReceiver: nativeInit chosen by signature

apklayer patch: the five-argument nativeInit is the signature this tree's framework has while it reports SDK 36 (upstream gates
it on POST_BAKLAVA), so the signature alone picks it.

Against external/robolectric 87aa52b08 (REVISION). Applied by scripts/build-runtime-overlay.sh onto the staged
upstream sources (<native>/aosp/robolectric-src); the result is compiled into native-runtime.jar ahead of Robolectric_all.jar.
---
diff --git a/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java b/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java
--- a/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java
+++ b/shadows/framework/src/main/java/org/robolectric/shadows/ShadowDisplayEventReceiver.java
@@ -88,7 +88,8 @@
     return nativeInit(receiver, msgQueue);
   }
 
-  @Implementation(minSdk = POST_BAKLAVA)
+  // apklayer patch: LineageOS 24's framework has this signature while reporting SDK 36; the signature alone picks it
+  @Implementation
   protected static long nativeInit(
       WeakReference<DisplayEventReceiver> receiver,
       WeakReference<Object> vsyncEventData,
